# Torch the Tower deals 2 damage to Liliana of the Veil (loyalty 3): she is left at 1 loyalty, not dead (the boundary below
# her loyalty), and was dealt damage by the spell, so when Lightning Bolt takes her last loyalty (CR 704.5i, dies, CR 700.4)
# the replacement exiles her instead of putting her into the graveyard (ruling: for any reason, not only lethal damage).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Torch the Tower
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Liliana of the Veil
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot2.Hand.Liliana of the Veil.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Torch the Tower.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Liliana of the Veil)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Liliana of the Veil.Counters.Loyalty = 1
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Liliana of the Veil)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate

[Expect]
Exile = Liliana of the Veil
Bot2.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Torch the Tower
